{"id":"n78926-1-10","stage":5,"title":"짤막하다 · 简短","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78926-1-10-1","ko":"선생님, 시간이 별로 안 남았습니다.","zh":"老师，时间已经不多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선생님,","meaning":"先生","explanation":"선생님：先生。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"2","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"4","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"별로","meaning":"（不）怎么，（不）太","explanation":"별로 在本句与后面的 안、없다、-지 않다 等否定表达合用，合起来表示“不怎么、不太”。否定意义需要和后文一起理解。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"남았습니다.","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남았습니다","audio":"/audio/28d438dbaf366a502564.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"先生","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"加在某人的姓氏或职业之后，以表示对其的尊敬。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"4692cef